Aim: Integrate any of the suitable monitoring and logging dashboards with your application.

Implementation and Output:
Step 1: Start the Docker container
docker start student-api-container

Step 2: Verify the running container
docker ps

The output confirms that student-api-container is running and port 3000 is mapped to port 3000 on the host.

Step 3: View application logs
docker logs student-api-container

This confirms that the application startup messages are available in the container logs.

Step 4: Monitor resource utilization
Open Docker Desktop and select student-api-container.
Click the Stats tab to observe the resource usage.

Step 5: Verify the API
Open the browser and visit: http://localhost:3000/students
